            "prompt": "Make the familiar request first to a close contact and then to a public-facing contact. Explain the change in address or directness.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "You need to contact someone again tomorrow. First ask a close friend; then ask a person assisting visitors whom you do not know personally. Keep the same practical request and explain how your address or directness changes. Neither person has already agreed.\nFamiliar meanings available: the other person; the other side; to thank; to be grateful; connection; contact; you, used respectfully.",
